== decide_pool_restriction ==
rog native, auto                           -> restrict=0xc03c03 width=8 tag=w8P
rog native, performance                    -> restrict=0xc03c03 width=8 tag=w8P
rog native, efficiency                     -> restrict=0x3fc3fc width=16 tag=w16E
rog native, all                            -> restrict=no width=24 tag=w24
rog under WSL2 (fabricated topology), auto -> restrict=no width=24 tag=w24
hypervisor unknown, auto                   -> restrict=no width=24 tag=w24
libdispatch pool, auto                     -> restrict=no width=24 tag=w24
uniform machine, auto                      -> restrict=no width=16 tag=w16
classes without masks, auto                -> restrict=no width=16 tag=w16
no class info, auto                        -> restrict=no width=8 tag=w8
externally pinned, auto                    -> restrict=no width=8 tag=w8
externally pinned, performance             -> restrict=0xc03c03 width=8 tag=w8P

== live probe invariants ==
effective_cpu_count >= 1: true
classes well-formed: true
